{
  "id": 22,
  "name": "cluster_aware_return_regret",
  "intent": "Adds a positive cluster_density term to steer the construction toward dense neighborhoods, reducing scattered edges and helping 2-opt refine compact tours. A reduced return_distance weight limits long hauls back to the start, while a small regret term preserves fallback safety.",
